    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nPrime Development Opportunity North Mayo, Belmullet, Co. Mayo\n\nThe subject lands represent an exceptional development opportunity in one of North Mayo's most desirable coastal locations. Extending to approximately 1.43 acres, the site offers significant potential for a high-quality residential development, subject to the granting of the necessary planning permission.\n\nStrategically positioned with panoramic views over the Atlantic Ocean, this attractive landholding presents an outstanding opportunity for developers and investors to capitalise on the continued demand for residential accommodation in Belmullet and the surrounding area.\n\nThe renowned Carne Golf Links clubhouse is visible across the bay, while the spectacular golf links themselves are just a short distance away. The popular tidal pool is located approximately 300 metres from the property, providing an exceptional amenity for swimming and outdoor recreation. Belmullet town, with its primary and secondary schools, local shops, healthcare services, and a full range of everyday amenities, is within easy reach. Ireland West Airport Knock is approximately a 1.5 hour drive away.\n\nZoning\nThe subject lands are strategically zoned under the Mayo County Development Plan 20222028, providing a strong planning framework and supporting their potential for future development.\n\n///"
      },
